{
  "title": "Juvenile Idiopathic Arthritis",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/basic-science/4108/juvenile-idiopathic-arthritis",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jan 2 2023",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Juvenile Idiopathic Arthritis is a chronic autoimmune inflammatory arthritis lasting greater than 6 weeks in a patient younger than 16 years of age that typically presents with morning joint stiffness and ocular infections.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is one of exclusion and presence of infection must be ruled out. One of the following must be present to confirm the diagnosis: rash, iridocyclitis, pericarditis, tenosynovitis, intermittent fever, presence of RF, C-spine involvement, morning stiffness.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is usually immunomodulating drugs and frequent ophthalmologic exams.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Demograpics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "female > male",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatomic location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "joint involvement ( **knee** > **hand/wrist** > ankle > hip > C-spine)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Genetics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "HLA markers",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "DR4 associated with polyarticular",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "DR8, DR5, DR2.1 associated with pauciarticular",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**RF- seropositive in <15%**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnostic criteria",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**a diagnosis of exclusion**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "must rule out infection",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "one of the following must be present to make diagnosis",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "rash",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "presence of RF",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "iridocyclitis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "C-spine involvement",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "pericarditis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "tenosynovitis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "intermittent fever",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "morning stiffness",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Associated conditions",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**C-spine involvement**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "may lead to kyphosis, facet ankylosis, and **atlantoaxial subluxation**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**Ocular involvement**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "typically consists of iridocyclitis, a type of anterior uveitis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "frequently indolent and requires immediate ophthalmologic evaluation for slit lamp examination",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "can lead to rapid loss of vision if untreated",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "increase risk with positive ANA titer",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**Stills disease**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "acute-onset JRA with multiple joint involvement, fever, rash, and splenomegaly",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "infection must be ruled out",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "male = female",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "usually presents at age 5-10 years",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Classification",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Onset",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**early onset** denotes onset before teens",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**late onset** denotes onset during teens or later",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "table": [
            {
              "header": true,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 3,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Classification of Juvenile Rheumatoid Arthritis**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Polyarticular (30%)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Hand/wrist involvement most common",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Deformity is wrist ulnar deviation and flexion with MCP stiffness in extended, swollen & radially deviated digits position",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "60% remission rate",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "> 5 joints involved",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Pauciarticular (50%)(oligoarticular)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Most common type**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "< 5 joints involved",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Large joint involvement (knees, ankles)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Asymmetric findings (leg length discrepancy, involved limb ends up LONGER)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "M:F =1:4",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Age 2-3y",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Systemic (20%)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Includes **Stills disease**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "systemic symptoms (rash, fever, multiple joint involvement) anemia, high WBC, elevated ESR, CRP, platelets",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Presentation",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Symptoms",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "morning stiffness and joint pain",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "visual changes",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "fever",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Physical exam",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "rash",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "iridocyclitis (can lead to rapid loss of vision if untreated)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Imaging",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Radiographs",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "often negative at presentation",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "juxta-articular, late osteopenia and joint destruction can be seen if disease progressive",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**obtain flexion-extension neck radiographs to rule out atlantoaxial instability**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Studies",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Laboratory",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "rheumatoid factor",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**RF seropositive in <15%**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "associated with higher incidence of chronic, active, and progressive disease",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "often results in more destructive DJD",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "more likely to progress into adult RA",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "**RF seronegative is more common**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "ANA",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "ANA positive is diagnostic",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "basic serology",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**values often normal and are not diagnostic**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Treatment",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Nonoperative",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "immunomodulating drugs (DMARDs) and frequent ophthalmologic exams",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "first line of treatment",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "medications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "**DMARDs** (disease modifying antirheumatic drugs)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "new class of medications that have had significant impact on outcomes",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "4",
                          "children": []
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "includes but not limited to",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "etanercept",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "1",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "text": "TNF inhibitor",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "2",
                                  "children": []
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "rituximab",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "1",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "text": "chimeric monoclonal antibody against CD20 on B cell surface",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "2",
                                  "children": []
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "azathioprine",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "1",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "text": "purine synthesis inhibitor",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "2",
                                  "children": []
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "high dose aspirin/NSAIDs",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "salicylates are now used less frequently secondary to DMARD success",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "occasionally, gold may be used",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**intra-articular steroid injections**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "**frequent ophthalmologic exams**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "slit-lamp examination twice yearly if ANA(-), every 4 months if ANA(+)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "progressive iridocyclitis can lead to rapid loss of vision if untreated",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Operative",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "synovectomy",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "epiphysiodesis",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "LLD (affected leg typically longer in oligoarticular disease)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "corrective osteotomies",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "extremity deformity",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "deferred until skeletal maturitity",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "arthrodesis and arthroplasty",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "for severe disease",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Prognosis",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "50% patients symptoms resolve without sequelae",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "25% are slightly disabled",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
